cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below. Figures in the cost index are engine estimates at stated default rates, not survey data."
type: dataset
title: "QuotedPart CNC Machining Cost Index, November 2026"
abstract: >-
  26 representative CNC milling, turning, Swiss and sheet-metal parts with published
  specs, plus two reference parts re-priced in 10 materials, priced at qty 1, 10, 100
  and 1,000 by QuotedPart's pricing engine at stated US default rates and material
  prices. Engine estimates, not survey data or industry averages. Recomputed monthly.
  Also includes the CNC quoting software comparison of November 6, 2026.
authors:
  - name: "QuotedPart (Helios One Oy)"
    city: Espoo
    country: FI
    website: "https://quotedpart.com"
version: "2026-11"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24030047"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://quotedpart.com/cnc-machining-cost-index"
repository: "https://github.com/Helios-One-Oy/cnc-machining-cost-index"
keywords:
  - CNC machining
  - machining cost
  - job shop
  - quoting
  - manufacturing cost estimation
  - sheet metal
